; Phase 42L - rank two of the Emberbound: the cross-realm/relic investigation. Reaching Stormcrown
; does not require (or light) the Storm Tyrant's brazier; the main story's defeat flags are never
; read or written here. Cass Vollen finally gets a voice (42K's carry-forward).

